---
# LLM settings — used for SBOM enrichment, analysis, and red-team payload generation
llm_api_key: "your-api-key-here"
llm_model: "gemini/gemini-2.0-flash"
llm_api_base: ""
llm_api_version: ""

# Target application
target_url: "http://localhost:8080"
chat_endpoint: "/chat"

# Auth type: none | bearer_token | api_key | basic
auth_type: "bearer_token"

# Bearer token (auth_type: bearer_token)
auth_token: ""

# API key header (auth_type: api_key)
auth_api_key_header: "X-API-Key"
auth_api_key_value: ""

# Basic auth (auth_type: basic)
auth_username: ""
auth_password: ""
---

# NuGuard Project Config

Copy this file to `.claude/nuguard.local.md` and fill in your values,
or run `/nuguard-config` to be guided through the setup interactively.

Do not commit `.claude/nuguard.local.md` — it contains credentials.
This example file is safe to commit.
